# CatalogService API test suite for IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate HTTP Client
# Based on the current CatalogService controllers/DTOs.
#
# IDE NOTE:
# IntelliJ may show OpenAPI inspection warnings for dynamic {{...}} UUID variables
# and LocalDateTime values without a timezone. These are editor inspections, not runtime errors.
# Run requests from top to bottom so IDs are captured before dependent requests.
#
# HOW TO USE
# 1) Run CatalogService on http://localhost:8083/api/v1
# 2) Run with Spring profile 'dev' so SecurityConfigDev permits all requests without JWT.
# 3) Run requests from top to bottom the first time because later requests reuse IDs captured from earlier responses.
# 4) Click the green Run icon beside any request in IntelliJ.
#
# Notes:
# - Spring Pageable receives page=0 for the first page.
# - The file automatically captures IDs into IntelliJ global variables.
# - Use a clean/dev database for the smoothest first run.
# - Current controllers do NOT expose DELETE for Cinema, Room, Seat, Movie, Event, or Showtime.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/api/v1
@page = 0
@size = 10


### ============================================================
### 0. Infrastructure / Swagger check
### ============================================================

### OpenAPI JSON - public
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json


### ============================================================
### 1. REGION
### Cinema depends on Region
### ============================================================

### 1.1 Create Region
POST {{baseUrl}}/regions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP Test Ho Chi Minh {{$timestamp}}",
  "slug": "http-test-hcm-{{$timestamp}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("regionId", String(response.body["data"]["id"]));
%}


### 1.2 Get Region by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions/{{regionId}}
Accept: application/json


### 1.3 Get all Regions
GET {{baseUrl}}/regions?page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 1.4 Update Region
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/regions/{{regionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "HTTP Test HCM Updated {{$timestamp}}"
}


### ============================================================
### 2. CINEMA
### Depends on Region
### ============================================================

### 2.1 Create Cinema
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinemas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "regionId": {{regionId}},
  "name": "CineGo HTTP Cinema {{$timestamp}}",
  "address": "72 Le Thanh Ton, District 1",
  "phone": "02812345678",
  "openingHours": "08:00 - 23:30",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

> {%
client.global.set("cinemaId", String(response.body["data"]["id"]));
%}


### 2.2 Get Cinema by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}
Accept: application/json


### 2.3 Filter Cinemas by Region + Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas?regionId={{regionId}}&status=ACTIVE&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 2.4 Filter Cinemas by keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas?keyword=CineGo&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 2.5 Update Cinema
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "72A Le Thanh Ton, District 1",
  "openingHours": "08:30 - 23:45"
}


### 2.6 Update Cinema status -> TEMPORARILY_CLOSED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "TEMPORARILY_CLOSED"
}


### 2.7 Restore Cinema status -> ACTIVE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### ============================================================
### 3. CINEMA AMENITY
### Depends on Cinema
### ============================================================

### 3.1 Add IMAX amenity to Cinema
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinema-amenities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cinemaId": "{{cinemaId}}",
  "amenity": "IMAX"
}


### 3.2 Add DOLBY_ATMOS amenity to Cinema
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinema-amenities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cinemaId": "{{cinemaId}}",
  "amenity": "DOLBY_ATMOS"
}


### 3.3 Get amenities by Cinema
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinema-amenities/cinema/{{cinemaId}}
Accept: application/json


### 3.4 Get Cinemas by amenity - paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinema-amenities/amenity/IMAX?page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 3.5 Cinema filter by amenity
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas?amenity=IMAX&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


