### ============================================================
### 6. SEAT
### Depends on Room + SeatType
### IMPORTANT: run Seat mutation tests BEFORE creating Showtime.
### ============================================================

### 6.1 Create Seat A1
POST {{baseUrl}}/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "rowChar": "A",
  "seatNumber": 1,
  "seatTypeName": "NORMAL",
  "isActive": true
}

> {%
client.global.set("seatId", String(response.body["data"]["id"]));
%}


### 6.2 Create Seat A2
POST {{baseUrl}}/seats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "rowChar": "A",
  "seatNumber": 2,
  "seatTypeName": "VIP",
  "isActive": true
}

> {%
client.global.set("seat2Id", String(response.body["data"]["id"]));
%}


### 6.3 Get Seat by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/seats/{{seatId}}
Accept: application/json


### 6.4 Get Seats by Room
GET {{baseUrl}}/seats/room/{{roomId}}?page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 6.5 Update Seat A1 -> VIP
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/seats/{{seatId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seatTypeName": "VIP"
}


### 6.6 Disable Seat A1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/seats/{{seatId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


### 6.7 Enable Seat A1 again
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/seats/{{seatId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}


