PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{movieId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DRAFT"
}


### 8.6 Restore Movie status -> ACTIVE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{movieId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


