### 11. ARTICLE
### movieId is optional; this test links the article to the Movie.
### ============================================================

### 11.1 Create Article
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "HTTP Test Article {{$timestamp}}",
  "slug": "http-test-article-{{$timestamp}}",
  "thumbnailUrl": "https://example.com/article.jpg",
  "content": "Full HTTP test article content.",
  "excerpt": "HTTP Client test article.",
  "category": "REVIEW",
  "tags": "[\"HTTP\",\"Movie\",\"Test\"]",
  "authorName": "Catalog Tester",
