Accept: application/json


### 12.3 Filter Events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?status=UPCOMING&cinemaId={{cinemaId}}&eventDateFrom=2030-01-01&eventDateTo=2030-01-31&page={{page}}&size={{size}}
Accept: application/json


### 12.4 Update Event
